# The words of the window of FreeSynergy Messages, English (ADR 0057: MessageFormat 2). Every id needs a German twin in de.mf2.
app-name = FreeSynergy Messages
app-tagline = Goal: Say something to someone: mail, chat and AI agents in one place. A message is only sent if it can be sent encrypted.
soon = coming soon
state-connected = The server answers and speaks the contract {$contract}.
state-down = No server is running: {$reason}
state-contract = This frontend does not fit the server: {$reason}
state-hint-down = Start the program with the command fs-messages; it starts the server and this window.
state-hint-contract = Install a matching version of FreeSynergy Messages; the window below only shows what is planned.
today-title = What it can do today
today-1 = Opens this window, finds its server and checks that both speak the same contract version.
today-2 = Says plainly what is not there yet; nothing here pretends to work.
today-3 = The core (message model, encrypted-only sending, mail connector, AI guard) exists as a library and is not wired to this window yet.
coming-title = What comes
coming-1 = Accounts: add a mail account (IMAP, JMAP, SMTP) and a Matrix account; messages stay encrypted end to end.
coming-2 = Conversations: list, open, read, unread marks, pin, move to folders, search.
coming-3 = Writing: reply, forward, drafts, attachments, formatting; send only encrypted.
coming-4 = Chat: rooms and direct messages over Matrix, with encryption shown honestly on every message.
coming-5 = Notifications per conversation, calm digests, mute.
coming-6 = AI agents as visible participants, only by invitation and with the agreement of everyone in the conversation; an emergency stop wins over everything.
coming-7 = A moderator and a protected space for conversations that need one. Planned, not scheduled, no promise.
coming-8 = Voice and video calls: open question whether they belong in this program. Planned, not scheduled.
menu-program = Messages
menu-new = New message
menu-accounts = Accounts
menu-search = Search
menu-chosen = Chosen: {$entry}
screen-start = Start
screen-coming = What comes
status-ready = Ready
